7.1 The Software is provided "AS IS," and the Developer makes no warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, and data integrity. The Developer does not warrant that the Software is free of defects, that its operation will be uninterrupted, that it will fully meet your expectations, or that it will be compatible with all hardware and software environments.

7.2 Although the Software applies encryption and integrity verification to cached resources, the Developer is not liable for damage to, loss of, or leakage of local data caused by system failure, disk corruption, malware, or third-party attacks. You are advised to back up your local database and important configurations regularly.

7.3 Third-party programs bundled with or linked to the Software (such as OpenVPN and WebView2) are provided as released by their respective publishers, and the Developer makes no warranty as to their defects, security, or compatibility. Under no circumstances shall the Developer be liable for data loss, service interruption, connection failure, business loss, or third-party service failure arising from the use of the Software, even if the Developer has been advised of the possibility of such damages.

7.4 **Software Updates:** The Software may automatically check for and download update installers, and the installation program is launched after your confirmation. The update process may fail due to the system environment, insufficient permissions, interception by third-party security software, or file locks. The Developer is not liable for update failures, configuration changes after an update, or data compatibility issues; please back up before performing important operations.

7.5 **Community Interaction:** The Developer does not guarantee the authenticity, legality, or accuracy of Community Content, nor is it liable for interactions or disputes between users or for losses arising therefrom. Community Content represents only the personal views of its publisher and does not represent the position of the Developer.

7.6 **Downloads and Cloud Sync:** The Developer makes no warranty as to the integrity, security, or usability of files obtained through the Download Manager, web download takeover, application updates, or Cloud Sync, or as to the persistence of cloud storage. Please verify and back up important files yourself.

