8.1 To the maximum extent permitted by law, the Developer and its affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages arising from the use of or inability to use the Software (including but not limited to loss of profits, loss of data, business interruption, and damage to goodwill), whether such damages are based on contract, tort (including negligence), or any other legal theory.

